^L
: >A: Eat a ring of teleport control!

: >This also works for other rings: conflict, regeneration, 
: >polymorph control, levitation (yikes!), protection, ...

: No kidding?!? If true, this is a *GREAT* spoiler! This would be the only
: way of getting intrinsic regenerate, polymorph control, conflict!!!
: How about increase damage, or gain strength, or adornment, or... Can you
: get intrinsic 25 charisma by eating a bunch of rings??? How about intrinsic
: +30 increase damage by eating 30 +1 rings????

1) It doesn't seem to give you extra STR/CHA/WIS/INT for eating things
   that give extra stats.
2) It does work for protection once.  So if you choose to eat a ring of 
   protection make sure its +5.
3) conflict would be a really bad one.  

: How about getting intrinsic regeneration like this... Does it make
: you hungry faster? It seems that there is a possibility of some abuse if
: something is not done to curb this... In the meanwhile, let's enjoy it!!!

There are a couple ways to be regenerating.

1) Eat/wear a ring of regeneration.  Its a bad thing because you will also get
   hungry faster.
2) Weild a weapon which conveys regeneration.  Doesn't affect food.
3) Polymorph into a regenerating monster.  Doesn't affect food.

